vertised from $2.55; page count/options determine total</dd><dt>Setup & other costs</dt><dd>No usage/setup fee in official guidance; printing/shipping/tax apply; retail distribution separate</dd><dt>Production timing</dt><dd>Usually 3–5 business days printing, then shipping</dd><dt>File requirements</dt><dd>Separate interior and cover PDFs, or use the cover tool</dd></dl><p class="notice">Use personal-use project path for a private book; retail distribution adds requirements and may add fees.</p><a href="https://www.lulu.com/create/print-books">Review the exact product ↗</a><details><summary>Evidence · checked 2026-10-05</summary><p class="source-ref">Sources: <a href="https://www.lulu.com/create/print-books">Lulu Print ↗</a> · <a href="https://help.lulu.com/en/support/solutions/articles/64000255486-how-to-create-a-print-book">Lulu Create ↗</a> · <a href="https://help.lulu.com/en/support/solutions/articles/64000255474-printing-faq">Lulu Production ↗</a> · <a href="https://blog.lulu.com/economics-of-self-publishing/">Lulu Fees ↗</a></p></details></article><article class="card" data-card data-group="paper-and-packaging" id="vendor-moo"><p class="meta">Mini card decks / business cards</p><h3>MOO</h3><span class="tag">50 Original business cards</span><p>A 50-card creative-prompt deck with different backs and one shared title side</p><dl><dt>Price example / USD</dt><dd>50 Original cards from $23</dd><dt>Setup & other costs</dt><dd>Full-color two-sided printing and Printfinity included; shipping/tax extra</dd><dt>Production timing</dt><dd>Selected stock supports next-day delivery before published weekday cutoff; check chosen configuration</dd><dt>File requirements</dt><dd>PDF/JPEG/PNG; vector PDF preferred for graphics and type</dd></dl><p class="notice">Printfinity varies one face, not both. Do not apply next-day delivery to every finish/stock.</p><a href="https://www.moo.com/us/business-cards/original">Review the exact product ↗</a><details><summary>Evidence · checked 2