dt>File requirements</dt><dd>PDF/PNG/JPEG/SVG/TIF/AI/PSD; CMYK PDF recommended</dd></dl><p class="notice">Quantity varies with dimensions; do not convert the dollar floor into a fixed 10/50/100-piece minimum.</p><a href="https://stickerapp.com/support/placing-orders/what-is-the-minimum-order-for-custom-stickers">Review the exact product ↗</a><details><summary>Evidence · checked 2026-10-05</summary><p class="source-ref">Sources: <a href="https://stickerapp.com/support/placing-orders/what-is-the-minimum-order-for-custom-stickers">Stickerapp Minimum ↗</a> · <a href="https://stickerapp.com/support/shipping">Stickerapp Shipping ↗</a> · <a href="https://stickerapp.com/support/artwork-design">Stickerapp Artwork ↗</a></p></details></article><article class="card" data-card data-group="textiles" id="vendor-rushordertees"><p class="meta">One-off printed shirts</p><h3>RushOrderTees</h3><span class="tag">1 printed shirt on eligible styles</span><p>One race-crew shirt for a friend’s first marathon</p><dl><dt>Price example / USD</dt><dd>One-shirt calculator quote; displayed Classic Tee $10.41 each applies to 50 units</dd><dt>Setup & other costs</dt><dd>Vendor says no hidden setup/screen/art-optimization fees; standard shipping free</dd><dt>Production timing</dt><dd>Selected orders can arrive in 2 business days; checkout confirms actual delivery</dd><dt>File requirements</dt><dd>PNG/JPEG/PDF/AI/EPS/PSD/TIFF; 300 dpi or vector preferred</dd></dl><p class="notice">Printed products only for no-minimum claim; embroidery starts at six.</p><a href="https://www.rushordertees.com/no-minimum/">Review the exact product ↗</a><details><summary>Evidence · checked 2026-10-05</summary><p class="source-ref">Sources: <a href="https://www.rushordertees.com/no-minimum/">Rush No Minimum ↗</a> · <a href="https://www.rushordertees.com/t-shirts/">Rush Shirts ↗</a> · <a href="https://www.rushordertees.com/help-center/uploading-artwork/">Rush Files ↗</a></p></details></article><article class="card" data-card data-group="textiles" id="vendor-stadri"><p class="meta">Embroidered and woven patches</p><h3>Stadri Emblems</h3><span class="tag">6 embroidered patches; 25 woven patches</span><p>Six matching road-trip-club merit badges</p><dl><dt>Price example / USD</dt><dd>Published example: six 2-inch, under-99%-embroidered patches at $20.63 each, $123.78 before extras/tax/shipping</dd><dt>Setup & other costs</dt><dd>Artwork/10 colors/plastic backing included; iron-on adds $0.15 each; separate setup amount not specified</dd><dt>Production timing</dt><dd>FAQ estimates 10–15 business days after final proof approval, plus shipping</dd><dt>File requirements</dt><dd>PDF/AI/EPS/SVG preferred</dd></dl><p class="notice">Size is (width + height) / 2; woven minimum is 25. Small orders may skip sewn sample.</p><a href="https://www.stadriemblems.com/products/embroidered-patches/">Review the exact product ↗</a><details><summary>Evidence · checked 2026-10-05</summary><p class="source-ref">Sources: <a href="https://www.stadriemblems.com/products/embroidered-patches/">Stadri Patches ↗</a> · <a href="https://www.stadriemblems.com/faq/">Stadri Faq ↗</a> · <a href="https://www.stadriemblems.com/order_process/">Stadri Process ↗</a></p></details></article></div><p class="empty" data-empty hidden>No vendors match. Try a material or reset the filters.</p></section><section id="proof" class="prose"><h2>A proof is cheaper than a guess.</h2><ol class="checklist"><li>Choose the question the sample must answer: fit, readability, color, finish or function.</li><li>Use the vendor’s exact current template. Check dimensions, bleed, safe area, material and accepted file format.</li><li>Confirm rights to every image, typeface and mark in the file.</li><li>Approve a proof at actual size. A digital proof checks placement; it does not establish physical color or feel.</li><li>Record the complete quote: setup, shipping, tax, finishing, duties and assembly, alongside unit quantity.</li><li>Inspect and document the sample before scaling. Keep the production file and revision number with the received specimen.</li></ol><p class="note">Companion: Currency’s original-art print <a href="/currency/#resources">resources</a>, <a href="/currency/#studio">studio</a> and <a href="/currency/#business">scenario worksheet</a>. Read its stated assumptions and limits before using the examples.</p></section><section id="sources"><h2>Read the source record.</h2><p>Sources were checked October 5, 2026. Each card links to the evidence behind its facts; analysis is PointCast editorial interpretation.</p><ol class="sources"><li id="source-sm-deals"><a href="https://www.stickermule.com/deals">Sticker Mule live deals ↗</a><small>Official vendor page · 2026-10-05 · Checked October 5, 2026</small></li><li id="source-sm-sample"><a href="https://www.stickermule.com/deals/b2b99d8e">Sticker Mule sample offer ↗</a><small>Official vendor page · 2026-10-05 · Checked October 5, 2026</small></li><li id="source-sm-stickers"><a href="https://www.stickermule.com/custom-stickers">Sticker Mule sticker minimum ↗</a><small>Official vendor page · 2026-10-05 · Checked October 5, 2026</small></li><li id="source-sm-pins"><a href="https://www.stickermule.com/products/custom-pins">Sticker Mule acrylic pins ↗</a><small>Official vendor page · 2026-10-05 · Checked October 5, 2026</small></li><li id="source-sm-magnets"><a href="https://www.stickermule.com/products/magnet-samples">Sticker Mule magnet samples ↗</a><small>Official vendor page · 2026-10-05 · Checked October 5, 2026</small></li><li id="source-sm-files"><a href="https://www.stickermule.com/faqs/stickermule/file-formats">Sticker Mule artwork formats ↗</a><small>Official vendor page · 2026-10-05 · Checked October 5, 2026</small></li><li id="source-scs-price"><a href="https://sendcutsend.com/pricing/">SendCutSend pricing ↗</a><small>Official vendor page · 2026-10-05 · Checked October 5, 2026</small></li><li id="source-scs-shipping"><a href="https://sendcutsend.com/shi